initialize.t.sol
├── given the accounting token or deposit token do not have associated feed route in the oracle registry
│  └── it should revert with PriceFeedRouteNotRegistered
└── given both the accounting token and deposit token have associated feed route in the oracle registry
   ├── given the vault is not the pending owner of the share token
   │  └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
   └── given the vault is the pending owner of the share token
      ├── it should initialize the vault with provided parameters
      └── it should set the vault as owner of the share token
